{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#card-zh","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bill 是 DSH Web 费用统计插件。它记录模型调用成本并回填已有会话用量，按模型、会话和时间展示支出，也将请求内容归因为模型、工具和系统等类别。聊天视图与侧栏显示费用和预算进度；可选提供 agent 查询工具。数据保存在 DSH_HOME，余额查询需 DeepSeek 凭据，定价和汇率联网获取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1335-1429","lib/index.js:1880-1940","lib/client.js:3286-3418","lib/pricing.js:448-480"]}
{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#card-en","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bill tracks DSH Web costs from model usage and session logs. Reports show spending by model and session, and attribute costs to models, tools, and system prompts. Chat and sidebar surfaces show costs and budget progress; agents can query totals. Records stay under DSH_HOME.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1335-1429","lib/index.js:1880-1940","lib/client.js:3286-3418","lib/pricing.js:448-480"]}
