{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#feature-1","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bill 的功能「会话费用报告」：汇总模型调用费用并按时间、模型或会话查看。通过聊天视图或侧栏打开报告，可检查总额、趋势和明细。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1790-1900","lib/client.js:3286-3418"]}
{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#feature-2","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bill 的功能「内容成本归因」：将请求中的内容按类别拆分并分摊费用。查看报告中的归因图表，可下钻到分类明细，了解工具、模型和系统内容的成本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/attribution.js:1-180","lib/client.js:1780-1860"]}
{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#feature-3","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bill 的功能「费用历史回填」：读取已有会话日志中的时间、模型和 token 用量，补入安装前的费用记录。启动时自动进行，日志没有请求正文，因此历史内容归因无法重建。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1450-1530"]}
{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#feature-4","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bill 的功能「agent 费用查询」：注册 bill_stats 工具后，agent 可查询总费用、模型拆分、峰谷时段和 30 天预测。调用工具时可限定会话、回溯天数或指定日历日期。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1335-1429"]}
{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-bill#feature-5","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-bill","commit":"14f859db6955eb11d505703e47728f3398347d9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bill 的功能「预算和多货币显示」：在 Cost 设置中设定预算金额、周期和货币，并选择报表显示货币。侧栏展示今日费用和预算进度，各客户端费用数字按汇率换算。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:882-967","lib/client.js:1641-1695","lib/pricing.js:448-480"]}
